<section class="sd-s sd-in"><div class="sd-w sd-in-g"><p class="sd-ey">Preface</p><p class="sd-big rv">Good study is not about the hours you sit. It is about <em>what your mind does</em> during them: recalling, connecting and returning, again and again.</p><dl class="sd-in-n stg"><div class="rv"><dt>Weeks of revision before a big exam</dt><dd data-count="6">6</dd></div><div class="rv"><dt>Minutes per focused session</dt><dd data-count="45">45</dd></div><div class="rv"><dt>Reviews to make a topic stick</dt><dd data-count="4">4</dd></div></dl></div></section>

<section class="sd-s sd-pl" id="planner"><div class="sd-w sd-pl-g"><div><p class="sd-ey">Countdown planner</p><h2 class="rv">How long until the exam?</h2><p class="sd-p">Enter your first exam date and the number of subjects. We will count the days and lay out a week-by-week plan.</p><label class="sd-lab" for="pl-d">First exam date<input type="date" id="pl-d"></label><label class="sd-lab" for="pl-s">Subjects <output id="pl-so">5</output><input type="range" id="pl-s" min="1" max="10" value="5"></label><figure class="sd-pl-i rv rv-c"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589760121999-2cd2c4ae0588?auto=format&fit=crop&w=640&h=360&q=75" alt="highlighters lying on handwritten study notes" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy"></figure></div><div class="sd-pl-o"><div class="sd-pl-c"><b id="pl-n">42</b><span>days to go</span></div><div class="sd-pl-w" id="pl-w" aria-live="polite"></div></div></div></section>

<section class="sd-dp"><div class="sd-w sd-dp-h"><p class="sd-ey">The reading rooms</p><h2 class="rv">Places that make you want to read</h2></div><div class="sd-dp-g"><div class="sd-dp-c" data-s="-.12"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529148482759-b35b25c5f217?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=700&q=75" alt="a bright library atrium with white balconies" width="520" height="700" loading="lazy"></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1546953304-5d96f43c2e94?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=700&q=75" alt="a long library reading room with wooden desks" width="520" height="700" loading="lazy"></figure></div><div class="sd-dp-c" data-s=".08"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1562349275-f5e7360af2dd?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=700&q=75" alt="a library with tall arched windows" width="520" height="700" loading="lazy"></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514513452089-17f8a9771ee8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=700&q=75" alt="a multi-level library atrium" width="520" height="700" loading="lazy"></figure></div><div class="sd-dp-c" data-s="-.2"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531259736756-6caccf485f81?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=700&q=75" alt="a gothic library reading hall" width="520" height="700" loading="lazy"></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1588581939864-064d42ace7cd?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=700&q=75" alt="library shelves lined with books" width="520" height="700" loading="lazy"></figure></div></div></section>

